          <formatted-text>
            <run fontsize='12'>Lead days.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>The graph illustrates the number of days in advance before the planned promo start date,  a promotion needs to be recorded in the system to be taken into account, based on the supplier&apos;s schedule.</run>
